  "title": "Google Maps and MapQuest Rename Lake Ontario to 'Lake America' in US",
  "summary": "Google Maps will show Lake Ontario as 'Lake America' for US users after a US government geographic naming change ordered by President Donald Trump. MapQuest, another US map provider, also refuses to change the name, highlighting a shift in naming policies.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Google Maps now shows Lake Ontario as 'Lake America' for US users after the US Geographic Names Information System formally changed the lake's name",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "MapQuest is getting an unexpected boost from its decision to defy President Trump’s renaming of Lake Ontario",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The renaming aims to align with national policy and reflect a shift in international policy",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
